              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na akeluvi makatambũũkye nthwau syoo ĩũlũ, makĩvw’ika wĩkalo wa tei na nthwau syoo, mothyũ moo masianĩtye; mothyũ ma akeluvi makelekele wĩkalo wa tei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
